# No live / staging DB changes

Unless the user **explicitly** asks to update production or staging data (or names a specific prod/staging `DATABASE_URL`):

- Do **not** run SQL, Prisma writes, scripts, or migrations against live or staging databases
- Do **not** use the wispy-resonance (prod) or other non-local Neon URLs for writes
- Prefer code-only fixes, local/dev DB, or ask before any remote DB mutation

Schema-only / read-only checks on remote DBs still need an explicit user request.
